WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.920
Last call for loose ends.

2
00:00:02.305 --> 00:00:04.560
Give your final theory a fair hearing:

3
00:00:04.905 --> 00:00:07.520
the person, the method, the motive,

4
00:00:07.865 --> 00:00:09.680
and the records that connect them.

5
00:00:10.145 --> 00:00:12.320
Then hear the best objection.

6
00:00:12.705 --> 00:00:15.520
Your next accusation will be the one that counts.
